        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>Step1Label1</name>
          <id>36</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Copy columns to the table from an external file (Excel, Word, etc.) using the clipboard. One of the columns is required: &quot;Barcode&quot;, &quot;Code&quot;, &quot;Item ID&quot; or &quot;Items&quot;.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>ستون‌ها را از یک فایل خارجی (Excel، Word و غیره) با استفاده از کلیپ‌بورد به جدول کپی کنید. یکی از ستون‌های &quot;بارکد&quot;، &quot;کد&quot;، &quot;شناسه قلم&quot; یا &quot;اقلام&quot; الزامی است.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Необходимо скопировать колонки в таблицу из внешнего файла (Excel, Word и пр.) через буфер обмена. Обязательно должна быть заполнена одна из колонок: &quot;Штрихкод&quot;, &quot;Код&quot;, &quot;Артикул&quot; или &quot;Номенклатура&quot;.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Sütunların dış dosyadan (Excel, Word vb.) panoya kopyalanarak tabloya yapıştırılması gereklidir. &quot;Barkod&quot;, &quot;Kod&quot;, &quot;Ürün kodu&quot; veya &quot;Stok kalemi&quot; sütunlarından biri mutlaka doldurulmalıdır.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Copy columns to the table from an external file (Excel, Word, etc.) using the clipboard. One of the columns is required: &quot;Barcode&quot;, &quot;Code&quot;, &quot;Item ID&quot; or &quot;Items&quot;.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Copy columns to the table from an external file (Excel, Word, etc.) using the clipboard. One of the columns is required: &quot;Barcode&quot;, &quot;Code&quot;, &quot;Item ID&quot; or &quot;Items&quot;.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Copy columns to the table from an external file (Excel, Word, etc.) using the clipboard. One of the columns is required: &quot;Barcode&quot;, &quot;Code&quot;, &quot;Item ID&quot; or &quot;Items&quot;.</value>
